    "causal_summary": "Elevate Storybook from a developer-only render catalog (Phase 006) into a first-class, dummy-proof, self-maintaining component surface: one-command launch a non-technical user can run, the relevant addons installed (a11y, test, themes, autodocs, designs), per-component autodocs, a co-located story-per-component convention enforced by a coverage gate, an AI-runnable story scaffold so every component change initializes/updates its story, and a documented folder architecture that follows the post-cutover pages/ + shared/ layout. Blocked on 007 cutover + WS-C reorg; drafts now, executes after.",
